# A dist archive carries the root files, loader/, packages/ddd-core and
# packages/ddd-wp from one commit. Everything below is development-only.
# Patterns are anchored and name the directory itself: git archive skips an
# export-ignored directory as a whole. Guarded by ReleaseArtifactTest.

